---
description: Rules for Next.js App Router and UI components
globs: frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}, web/**/*.{ts,tsx}
---
- Prefer React Server Components for initial data fetching where possible.
- Use TanStack Query for client-side interactions, folder traversal, and cache invalidation.
- Global UI states (Modals, Multi-file upload drawer, selection) must live in Zustand stores.
- Implement Breadcrumbs navigation with dynamic route slugs (`/rooms/[roomId]/folder/[folderId]`).
- PDF Preview: Render using browser-native iframe or `@react-pdf-viewer/core`.